<section class="page-hero"><span class="pub-kicker">Connected operation</span><h1>Your systems remain yours.<br>StockChief connects the work between them.</h1><p>Every business connects its own accounts. Credentials are protected, connections are workspace-scoped, and live capability is qualified provider by provider.</p></section>
